{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/495976-fiasco-by-night-a-vampire-the-masquerade-playset-for-fiasco","id":495976,"title":"Fiasco by Night, a Vampire: the Masquerade playset for Fiasco","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-28T23:10:34-07:00","id":495976,"title":"Fiasco by Night, a Vampire: the Masquerade playset for Fiasco","content":"What's better than Fiasco or Vampire? Playing both at once!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/rpg/i/fbn_cover2.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I've co-authored a new Fiasco playset that lets you play as Kindred in a typical World of Darkness city. Familiarity with VtM is a must for this playset, and it's a fun way to introduce Vampire players to Fiasco.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/fiasco-by-night/\" target=\"_blank\">Download the playset here: http://flamingporcupine.net/fiasco-by-night/</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>The Score</b></span><br /> <b>A Slow Burn</b><br /> The endless city nights shine with artificial glitter almost as bright as the daylight you will never see again but are afraid to forget. You hear the hum and clatter of mortal activity everywhere like never before. Details of each tiny life reveal themselves in ways that only a predator\u2019s eyes can see. In a single moment you are finally alive again, feeling the heat of passion blast you in waves. You want it to never end. The limp body drops from your hands to the floor.<br /> <br /> From the lavish parties to the lowest sewers everyone is trying to stake a claim. There are never enough places to hunt and too many ways to risk exposure. The quick and the clever might survive the night, but how much power will it take to survive eternity? Every scheme, every bargain, and every gamble buys you an edge and earns you an enemy.<br /> <br /> You reach out \u2013 for love, warmth, humanity \u2013 but it can\u2019t last. Time and old age will take them away. Time and old age, if others of your kind don\u2019t do it first. Before long, the sadistic joy of playing your peers against each other will be all you have left.<br /> <br /> <b>Notes</b><br /> Fiasco by Night takes place in the world of Vampire: the Masquerade and assumes players are familiar with the classic World of Darkness setting. You are Kindred; probably members of the Camarilla, though possibly Anarchs or even Independent.<br /> <br /> It's a Fiasco, so play fast, loose, and dangerous in a way that few dare to do with their recurring Vampire characters. Fiasco's format helps both new role-players and veterans to take risks, think fast, and play scenes toward a concise point. Use this playset to shake up your experience of Vampire and try out role-play techniques that can enrich your chronicles. It's also great for a quick fix of Vampire. </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:10px\">(Note to Mods: I posted this in the VtM sub-forum and here, because it seemed appropriate to both. If this is too much, sorry, I don't mind deleting one)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":10,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","user":"Demon Cat","date":". 04-29-2015, 04:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}